# Docker

This project uses Docker. Do not run `php artisan` against a random local PHP unless the command is tests (see below).

## App / migrations / tinker

```bash
docker compose exec api php artisan <command>
```

The `api` image is production-shaped (`composer install --no-dev`). Pest is not installed inside it. `docker compose exec api php artisan test` will fail with "Command test is not defined".

## Tests

Run Pest on the host (this repo's `vendor/` is a full dev install):

```bash
php artisan test
php artisan test tests/Feature/ExampleTest.php
php artisan test --filter=testName
```

Pint likewise: `vendor/bin/pint --dirty`.
